#### admin.php


The admin panel starts with a check that the user’sROLEis “Admin”:


```
<?php
session_start();
include_once("db_utils.php");

if ($_SESSION["ROLE"] != "Admin") {
  header('Location: /index.php');
  die;
}
?>

```


After that, there’s a mostly static page that callsget_top_playersand makes a table:


![image-20240125102837173](/img/image-20240125102837173.png)


get_top_playersis defined indb_utils.php.


